WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.397
Every file in your folder gets one of
three verdicts.

2
00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:11.280
Most pictures are simply Sent, with no
badge, because the picture is a true copy.

3
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:18.922
A Photoshop file saved without a full
preview is sent with an approximate badge.

4
00:00:19.492 --> 00:00:23.494
An InDesign file cannot be read, so it is
not sent,

5
00:00:23.494 --> 00:00:26.319
and the row tells you how to fix it.
